        "jsCode": "// Filter items where score > 0.7\nconst filtered = items.filter(item => item.json.score > 0.5);\n\n// Map filtered results to simplified output\nreturn filtered.map(item => ({\n  json: {\n    memory: item.json.document.pageContent,\n    score: item.json.score\n  }\n}));\n"
